---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { demoEmail, waitlistEmail } from '../data/content';
---
<Layout title="Book an AI Hotel Chatbot Demo | iloop.id" description="Book an iloop.id AI hotel chatbot demo or ask about a pilot in Indonesia. Discuss guest messaging channels, staff handover and your property’s setup.">
  <section class="page-intro container contact-intro"><p class="section-label">Let’s talk</p><h1>Book a demo <span>for your hotel</span></h1><p class="lead">See how iloop.id handles guest communication for hotel teams in Indonesia on WhatsApp, website chat and email. We’ll walk through replies using your hotel’s information and how staff take over conversations. Ask about a pilot for your property.</p></section>
  <section class="contact-options container" aria-label="Contact options"><article class="demo-option"><p class="section-label">A personal walkthrough</p><h2>Book a demo.</h2><p>See how guest replies, stay messages and team handover could work for your property.</p><h3>A good place to start</h3><ul><li>Your hotel and the properties you manage</li><li>The channels your guests use</li><li>Your booking engine or property management system</li></ul><a class="button" href={demoEmail} data-cta-action="demo" data-cta-placement="contact-demo">Email us for a demo</a><p class="email-note">Opens your email app with the demo subject ready.</p></article><article class="waitlist-option" id="early-access"><p class="section-label">Be first in the loop</p><h2>Join the waitlist.</h2><p>Interested in trying iloop.id? Get in touch about early access and ask about a pilot for your hotel.</p><a class="button button-outline" href={waitlistEmail} data-cta-action="waitlist" data-cta-placement="contact-waitlist">Join the waitlist</a><p class="email-note">Opens your email app with the waitlist subject ready.</p></article></section>
  <section class="direct-contact container"><div><p class="section-label">Prefer to write directly?</p><a class="email-address" href="mailto:hello@iloop.id">hello@iloop.id</a></div><p>Send us your questions and a little about your property. If you use webmail, copy this address into a new message.</p></section>
</Layout>
